    `.rsproj`'s `Sdk="Kubuno.Rust.Sdk/…"` resolves on a machine that never ran this repository's own
    pack-sdk.ps1/NuGet.config dance. Verified live (see docs/RSPROJ.md work package 5): a fresh,
    otherwise-empty NuGet package cache + a NuGet.Config containing only this one source restores
    and builds a `.rsproj` successfully.
